---
status: 'published';
// Submit Art page for Synchronize Coffee
import SyncCoffeeLayout from '@/layouts/SyncCoffeeLayout.astro';
---

<SyncCoffeeLayout
  title="Submit Art - Synchronize Coffee"
  description="Submit your artwork for the rotating gallery at Synchronize Coffee."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section
    class="relative overflow-hidden py-16 md:py-24 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950"
  >
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img
        src="/images/shared/orange-loops-green-background.webp"
        alt=""
        role="presentation"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-35 dark:opacity-45"
      />
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/75 via-white/45 to-white/15 dark:from-blue-950/70 dark:via-blue-950/50 dark:to-gray-950/65"
      >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center"
    >
      <h1
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-6"
      >
        Share Your Art
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed"
      >
        Our walls are a rotating gallery for local creativity. Submit your work
        and help shape the room.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why We Display Art -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p
        class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 mb-4"
      >
        Why we display art
      </p>

      <h2
        class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-6"
      >
        The walls are part of the conversation.
      </h2>

      <div
        class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
      >
        <p>
          Art changes the feeling of a place. It gives people something to
          notice, talk about, return to, and remember.
        </p>

        <p>
          Synchronize regularly features work by local and regional artists
          because creative work helps make the café feel connected to the people
          around it.
        </p>

        <p>
          Every exhibition brings a new perspective into the room and gives
          visitors something unexpected to discover while they drink, work,
          gather, or linger.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We're Looking For -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-blue-950/40">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4"
        >
          What We're Looking For
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          We review all submissions and look for work that fits the space,
          contributes to the atmosphere of the café, and creates a meaningful
          experience for visitors.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 p-6 shadow-sm"
        >
          <h3
            class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-3"
          >
            Broad mediums
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Painting, photography, illustration, printmaking, textiles, mixed
            media, and other wall-friendly work are welcome.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 p-6 shadow-sm"
        >
          <h3
            class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-3"
          >
            Local perspective
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            We especially enjoy work connected to the neighborhood, region,
            everyday life, imagination, place, or community.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 p-6 shadow-sm"
        >
          <h3
            class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-3"
          >
            Café-friendly scale
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Work should be ready to hang, safe for a public setting, and suited
            to a shared room where people gather throughout the day.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Artwork Feature -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div
      class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center"
    >
      <div>
        <p
          class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 mb-4"
        >
          A rotating gallery
        </p>

        <h2
          class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4"
        >
          Every show changes the room.
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Exhibits typically run for several weeks. We coordinate timing,
            hanging needs, artwork labels, and sale details with each selected
            artist.
          </p>

          <p>
            Our goal is to make the process clear and approachable while still
            caring for the quality and feel of the space.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900"
      >
        <img
          src="/images/shared/orange-loops-green-background.webp"
          alt="Abstract orange loop artwork on a green background"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Submission Form -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <p
          class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 mb-4"
        >
          Submit your work
        </p>

        <h2
          class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4"
        >
          Tell us what you'd like to share.
        </h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Share a little about yourself, your work, and when it may be
          available. This demo form routes to a confirmation page, but no real
          submission is collected.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-4 rounded-r-md mb-6"
      >
        <p class="text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-200 text-sm">
          <strong>Concept Demo:</strong> This is a concept website built by ImagineThis.Site
          to demonstrate possibilities. No real submission will be sent.
        </p>
      </div>

      <form
        action="/concept/sync-coffee/submit-art/confirmed/"
        method="get"
        class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5"
      >
        <!-- Artist info -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label
              for="artistName"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Artist Name</label
            >
            <input
              id="artistName"
              name="artistName"
              type="text"
              required
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label
              for="email"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Email</label
            >
            <input
              id="email"
              name="email"
              type="email"
              required
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label
              for="phone"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Phone <span class="text-gray-500">(optional)</span></label
            >
            <input
              id="phone"
              name="phone"
              type="tel"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label
              for="portfolio"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Portfolio / Social Link</label
            >
            <input
              id="portfolio"
              name="portfolio"
              type="url"
              placeholder="https://…"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Work details -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label
              for="title"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Artwork / Series Title</label
            >
            <input
              id="title"
              name="title"
              type="text"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label
              for="medium"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Medium</label
            >
            <input
              id="medium"
              name="medium"
              type="text"
              placeholder="e.g., watercolor, film, mixed media"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label
              for="dimensions"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Dimensions</label
            >
            <input
              id="dimensions"
              name="dimensions"
              type="text"
              placeholder="e.g., 16x20 in"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label
              for="availabilityStart"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Available From</label
            >
            <input
              id="availabilityStart"
              name="availabilityStart"
              type="date"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label
              for="availabilityEnd"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Available Until</label
            >
            <input
              id="availabilityEnd"
              name="availabilityEnd"
              type="date"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label
              for="price"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Price <span class="text-gray-500">(optional)</span></label
            >
            <input
              id="price"
              name="price"
              type="text"
              placeholder="$"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-6">
            <input
              id="nfs"
              name="nfs"
              type="checkbox"
              class="accent-blue-700"
            />
            <label for="nfs" class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              Not for sale
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label
            for="statement"
            class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
            >Artist Statement / Notes</label
          >
          <textarea
            id="statement"
            name="statement"
            rows="5"
            class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            placeholder="Tell us about this work."></textarea>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label
            for="images"
            class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
            >Upload Images <span class="text-gray-500">(optional)</span></label
          >
          <input
            id="images"
            name="images"
            type="file"
            accept="image/*"
            multiple
            class="block w-full text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 file:mr-4 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-md file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:bg-blue-50 file:text-blue-700 hover:file:bg-blue-100 dark:file:bg-blue-900/30 dark:file:text-blue-200"
          />
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">
            Uploads are not processed on this demo.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <input
            id="agree"
            name="agree"
            type="checkbox"
            required
            class="accent-blue-700"
          />
          <label for="agree" class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            I understand this is a concept form and agree to the hanging and
            venue guidelines.
          </label>
        </div>

        <div
          class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4"
        >
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            In a real café, we would review and reply within one business day.
          </p>
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="bg-orange-600 text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-md font-semibold hover:bg-orange-700 transition dark:bg-orange-500 dark:hover:bg-orange-400"
          >
            Submit Proposal
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Other Ways to Participate -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-blue-950/40">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2
        class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4"
      >
        Not submitting art right now?
      </h2>
      <p
        class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto"
      >
        You can still be part of what happens here. Come by to see the work on
        the walls, attend a performance, or reserve a table for your own
        gathering.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center">
        <a
          href="/concept/sync-coffee/perform/"
          class="inline-block border border-blue-700 text-blue-700 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-50 transition dark:border-blue-300 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/30"
          >Book a Performance</a
        >
        <a
          href="/concept/sync-coffee/reserve/"
          class="inline-block bg-orange-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-orange-700 transition dark:bg-orange-500 dark:hover:bg-orange-400"
          >Reserve a Space</a
        >
        <a
          href="/concept/sync-coffee/contact/"
          class="inline-block border border-blue-700 text-blue-700 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-50 transition dark:border-blue-300 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/30"
          >Contact Us</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SyncCoffeeLayout>
